&NSTATE
! Plant-N state characterization for the v15_s4_nstate variant.
!   nstate_mode = 1 : frozen S1 piecewise psi on total organ N (default;
!                     this file absent reproduces S1 byte-for-byte)
!   nstate_mode = 2 : fused psi* -- functional-N basis (v4 functional N
!                     fused with the S2 signal N) on the unified dilution
!                     curve; two-sided anchoring: -1 at the reference-band
!                     floor (floor_ratio), +1 at physical capacity
!                     (cap_density). Deficiency side is the NNI deficit:
!                     psi* = (NNI_f - 1)/(1 - r_min).
!   state_tau     : optional first-order relaxation (days) of the published
!                   growth-side state (nb_get_psi: XNSTRES / root partition
!                   / photo / PODS); the root-uptake feedback
!                   (nb_get_uptake_psi) always reads the instantaneous
!                   state. 0 disables relaxation (default).
! Placement: run directory (name NState.nml), or any path exported as
! DSSAT_NSTATE_NML (calibration sandboxes).
 nstate_mode = 2
 state_tau   = 0.0
/
